## Test Case формат — ФИКСИРАН

Classical формат, в fenced code block (за ADO sync):

````text
```
Test Case ID: {PREFIX}-{NN}
Title: [{Category}] [{Priority}] Short description
Preconditions:
  - Setup step
Test Steps:
  1. First action
  2. Second action
Expected Result: Detailed expected outcome
Actual Result: [To be filled during execution]
```
````

**Правила:**
- **ID:** `{PREFIX}-{NN}` (DO-00, ELSA-01). Dynamic варианти: `{PREFIX}-{NN}-D`. Префиксът се пита, ако не е в context.
- **Title:** `[Category]` (Positive / Positive-Dynamic / Negative / Security / Boundary / Edge / Encoding / Performance) + `[Priority]` ([High] / [Medium] / [Low]).
- **Preconditions:** За dynamic — задължително "Test data is randomly generated per execution".
- **Test Steps:** Numbered. За dynamic — стъпка 1 описва генерирането.
- **Expected Result:** За hardcoded — точни стойности. За dynamic — структура/формат/equality-to-input.
- **Actual Result:** Винаги `[To be filled during execution]`.

**Metadata** (markdown коментар НАД test case, не в code block-а — не отива в ADO):

```markdown
<!--
Requirement Reference: BR-{ID} — "{text}" (or ⚠️ NO EXPLICIT BR — derived from {source})
Scenario Origin: {CATALOG-ID e.g. SPEC-021} (or "Direct from requirement")
Scope: IN-SCOPE (Requirement-Driven) | REQUIREMENT-ADJACENT (Approved Proposal P-{N})
Data Strategy: HARDCODED | DYNAMIC | BOTH (paired with TC-{ID})
-->
```

**Файл:** `docs/test-cases/TestCases-{Endpoint}.md`.

